    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eriya n'Omukama Ahaziya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabbu obu yamazire kufa, Abamowabbu bakeemera Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya akaraba omu idirisa ery'ekisiika kye ekya haiguru omunsi Samaliya, yahutaara muno, nukwo kutuma abakwenda naabagambira ati: “Mugende mukaguze Baali-zebubi omucwezi wa Ekeroni, obu ndaaba ndi w'okukira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu malaika wa MUKAMA akagambira Eriya omutisubi ati: “Imuka ogende oitirane abakwenda ab'omukama wa Samaliya, obakaguze oti: ‘Omu Isirairi habw'okutabamu Ruhanga, nikyo kirukubatwara kukaguza Baali-zebubi, omucwezi w'Ekeroni?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lero nu, MUKAMA naagamba ati: ‘Ekitabu eki obyamireho eki, torukwija kukiimukaho; mazimakwo noija kufa.’” Aho Eriya yagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakwenda baagaruka mb'omukama, yabakaguza ati: “Mugarwirwe ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugarukamu bati: “Tukaitirana omusaija yatugambira ati: ‘Mugarukeyo mb'omukama ayabatumire, mumugambire muti, MUKAMA naakaguza ngu: Omu Isirairi habw'okutabamu Ruhanga, nikyo orukutumira abakwenda okukaguza Baali-zebubi omucwezi w'Ekeroni? Lero nu, ekitabu obyamireho eki, torukwija kukiimukaho mazimakwo noija kufa.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yabakaguza ati: “Omusaija anyakwizire kubaitirana, akabagambira ebintu nk'ebi wa mulingo ki ogu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 1:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugarukamu bati: “Akaba ajwaire ekijwaro eky'ebyoya, ayeteegere orukoba.” Yagamba ati: “N'Eriya Omutisubi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo omukama yamutwekiire engabwa ey'amakumi ataano, hamu n'abasaija be amakumi ataano, yagenda omba Eriya, yamusanga aikaliire ha mutwe gw'orusozi, yamukaguza ati: “Iwe omuntu wa Ruhanga, omukama naakweta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 9:54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eriya yagarukamu engabwa ey'amakumi ataano ati: “Obu ndaaba ndi muntu wa Ruhanga, omurro guruge omwiguru, gukusiiriize n'abantu bawe abo amakumi ataano.” Ahonaaho, omurro gwaruga omwiguru, gwamusiiriiza n'abantu be amakumi ataano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akongera yamutumira engabwa endi ey'abantu amakumi ataano, hamu n'abe amakumi ataano, yagenda yamugambira ati: “Iwe omuntu wa Ruhanga, omukama akuragiire ngu: ‘oije bwango!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eriya yabagarukamu ati: “Obu ndaaba ndi muntu wa Ruhanga, omurro guruge omwiguru gukusiiriize, n'abantu bawe amakumi ataano.” Ahonaaho, omurro gwaruga omwiguru, gwamusiiriiza, n'abantu be amakumi ataano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yagaruka yamutumira engabwa ey'abantu amakumi ataano omurundi gwa kasatu engabwa ey'abantu amakumi ataano yagenda, yateeza amaju omumaiso g'Eriya, yamwesengereza naagamba ati: “Iwe muntu wa Ruhanga, nkwesengeriize, ongirre embabazi hamu n'abantu bange, oganyire obwomeezi bwaitu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omurro gukaruga omwiguru, gwayokya engabwa ibiri ezaabandize ez'abantu amakumi ataano, hamu n'abantu baabu amakumi ataano; baitu nyowe nkwesengeriize, ongirre embabazi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo, malaika wa MUKAMA yagambiire Eriya ati: “Genda na uwe, otamutiina.” Aho yaimuka, yagenda na uwe mb'omukama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yamugambira ati: “MUKAMA naakaguza ati: ‘Eki otwekiire abakwenda okukaguza Baali-zebbuli omucwezi w'Ekoroni omu Isirairi, habw'okutabamu Ruhanga ow'okukaguza? Habweki, ekitabu obyamireho eki, torukwija kukiimukaho, noija kufa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazimakwo yafaakwo, MUKAMA nkooku yagambire, Eriya nkooku yabalize. Omu mwaka ogwa kabiri ogwa Yehoramu mutabani wa Yehosafaati, omukama wa Yuda, owanyina Yehoramu yateera engoma omu kiikaro kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebindi Ahaziya ebi yakozire, bikahandiikwa omu kitabu eky'obusinge obw'abakama aba Isirairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
